1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,400
You’re an actor, a director, and a
camera operator.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,400
The interview starts soon.

3
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:10,900
Talk with them.

4
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:13,700
They’re about to begin.

5
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:16,893
Okay?

6
00:00:16,893 --> 00:00:18,993
Rest a bit. See how it feels.

7
00:00:19,493 --> 00:00:23,493
If it gets too much, switch with
someone.

8
00:00:27,493 --> 00:00:29,493
You can swap with someone else.

9
00:00:29,493 --> 00:00:33,493
Take a break. We’ll take turns
filming.

10
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:36,046
Everyone, keep talking.

11
00:00:36,046 --> 00:00:39,486
The camera operator is also an
actor in this.
